WEBVTT

00:08.760 --> 00:10.160
Chu Meng.

00:11.240 --> 00:13.573
Summon the second son to see me.

00:29.840 --> 00:33.387
Father I've almost defeated those remnants in Yan Bei.

00:33.640 --> 00:35.973
Why call me back at this time?

00:42.760 --> 00:46.080
Father, how is your wound?

00:59.320 --> 01:00.720
Father.

01:02.080 --> 01:05.480
I've thought for a long time.

01:06.440 --> 01:12.160
I've decided to pass the throne to your elder brother Father.

01:12.240 --> 01:16.960
Father since I was young, when you told me to go east I never went west.

01:17.200 --> 01:22.720
You said to recover lost territories I trained in martial arts and studied military texts just to help you after the northern expedition.

01:22.800 --> 01:28.280
I always led from the front in every battle because I know only our Sikong family doesn't fear death.

01:28.360 --> 01:32.053
The brothers under me will truly fight with all their might.

01:33.640 --> 01:37.560
Father, I never thought to compete with elder brother.

01:40.160 --> 01:42.827
I just wanted to be a good son.

01:43.440 --> 01:47.480
Second son, you are most like me.

01:49.440 --> 01:50.840
Father.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.720
But for Xuan Kingdom's future.

02:00.720 --> 02:04.080
I cannot keep you.

02:05.640 --> 02:07.040
Father.

02:13.720 --> 02:15.120
My son.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.440
My son.

02:22.520 --> 02:23.920
I understand.

03:19.760 --> 03:22.840
Xu'er xu'er.

03:23.840 --> 03:25.240
Xu'er.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.307
It was never your fault.

03:31.080 --> 03:33.560
It was my fault as a father.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.040
I'm sorry, my son.

03:41.840 --> 03:43.480
I'm sorry, my son.

03:44.720 --> 03:46.120
After we get there.

03:48.080 --> 03:50.080
I'll make it up to you.

03:51.200 --> 03:55.680
Then we two will ride horses together.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.920
Fish together.

04:00.360 --> 04:01.760
Hunt together.

